# Gitignored, machine-local, and required by every Gradle task: without it
# `./gradlew testDebugUnitTest` fails in a worktree with "SDK location not
# found", so the Android half of the DoD was unrunnable anywhere except the
# main checkout.
android/local.properties
# Supabase's linked project ref. Without it the staging drill and Tier 2
# verifier refuse in a worktree ("linked project ref is unknown").
supabase/.temp/project-ref
# The linked project's IPv4 session-pooler address. Without it the CLI falls
# back to the direct host, which is IPv6-only, and the schema-compat prod lane
# fails in every worktree with "IPv6 is not supported on your current network"
# (2026-11-10). Holds the host and user, no password.
supabase/.temp/pooler-url
